  - m_Id: 2833776002203648
    m_Localized: "Practicing the shot. \nRMB - sight, LMB - shot. \nGet into the
      nightmares!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2837800264925184
    m_Localized: Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2838748307652608
    m_Localized: How strange...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2839728659103744
    m_Localized: "We only shoot STRAIGHT. \nWe don't wave the gun up and down. \nIt
      doesn't work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2841394309496832
    m_Localized: I'll score the most points!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2842396106424320
    m_Localized: 'I have to win.

      I''m going to be the sheriff!'
